        "jp": "あなたたちに合った武器を作るために、\r\nまずは「戦い方」を観察させてもらったわ。",
        "official_en": "To make you suitable weapons, I needed to see how you fight... But I think I’ve seen enough.",
        "real_en": "I've been watching how you fight so I can make weapons suited to you."
